  "title": "Forms I-XV of the triliteral verb and Forms I-IV of the quadriliteral verb, after Wright",
  "collation": "Collated on 2026-11-16 against the page images of volume I (Internet Archive scan of the Toronto copy): the fifteen patterns of the triliteral verb were compared letter by letter with the table in §35 (p. 29), the four quadriliteral patterns with the table in §68 (p. 48); all nineteen agree. §66 (pp. 46-47) and §§67-72 (pp. 47-49) were read in full. Not yet seen in the page images: the paragraphs on Forms I-XI (§§36-62, start pages from the table of contents) and §§91-93. Status stays draft until a second, independent check. Spelling as in docs/data-model.md §4 (Wright prints hamzat al-waṣl as alif with kasra, as here).",
